  {"comment": "The Browser's component color bars (mitcad#1876), tools/ui-browser-component-colors-test.sh: a 20 x 20 x 5 box in the root; Bolt placed twice, Bolt:1 (O1) and its copy Bolt:2 (O2), with a 5 x 5 x 20 box; Plate:1 (O3) of Plate with a 40 x 30 x 3 box; the root active."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": "xy", "corner": [0, 0],
    "length": 20, "width": 20, "height": 5, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "create_component", "name": "Bolt", "transform": {"translation": [0, 40, 0]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": "xy", "corner": [0, 0],
    "length": 5, "width": 5, "height": 20, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "activate_component", "component": "Root"},
  {"cmd": "copy_occurrence", "occurrence": "Bolt:1", "transform": {"translation": [20, 40, 0]}},
  {"cmd": "create_component", "name": "Plate", "transform": {"translation": [60, 0, 0]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": "xy", "corner": [0, 0],
    "length": 40, "width": 30, "height": 3, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "activate_component", "component": "Root"}
